<!--Post: 7776--><!--Time: 1108678138-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7776"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Thinker<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Thinker<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 2:08 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Nm_pi <BR>I totally agree.  In fact, the only part that doesn&#39;t ring to BTK is the bathtub thing. However, with the manual strangulation thrown in, I feel this could very well be connected. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
